  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armed actors&#xbf; engagement and advocacy towards preventing and mitigating violence in the Blue Nile State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The proposal aims at contributing to the mitigation of violence and promotion of stability in the Blue Nile region through navigating the complex inter-ethnic tensions and shifting alliances specifically due to the April 2023 clashes. To do so, the proposed action focuses on increasing protection dialogue and compliance of humanitarian norms among key armed groups and capacitating local CSOs and communities to advocate on civilian protection.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
